{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This soundtrack was made and edited using Reaper and FMOD. Although FMOD has no part in this uploaded soundtrack, it should be stated that the game itself (and ultimately the experience) relies on it, and for the full experience I (Lily, the composer) <strong>heavily</strong> recommend playing the game first.<br><br>For this soundtrack I focused a lot on melancholy feelings, things that sound happy but under the surface they're really sad, as is the story behind <i>Forgetmenots</i>. </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698190?t=1748034884","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3698190?t=1748034884","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698190/cc2d68b458da69ac021bcea35ebe69792c2ea656/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748034884","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698190/cc2d68b458da69ac021bcea35ebe69792c2ea656/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748034884","categories":[{"description":"Additional High-Quality Audio","id":50}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This soundtrack was made and edited using Reaper and FMOD. Although FMOD has no part in this uploaded soundtrack, it should be stated that the game itself (and ultimately the experience) relies on it, and for the full experience I (Lily, the composer) <strong>heavily</strong> recommend playing the game first.<br><br>For this soundtrack I focused a lot on melancholy feelings, things that sound happy but under the surface they're really sad, as is the story behind <i>Forgetmenots</i>. </p>","developers":["Forgetful Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3562540","name":"Forgetmenots"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3698190/fc17c83c592496623f0c4cf686eb9c61c1f3c9c0/header.jpg?t=1748034884","is_free"